@node saturation Plugin Developer Guide
@section Developer Guide

Saturation / Harmonic Exciter — adds warmth and harmonic richness.

@subsubheading What It Does

Adds harmonic overtones to audio through nonlinear waveshaping, simulating the pleasing distortion characteristics of analog equipment (tape machines, tube amplifiers). At low drive levels, adds subtle warmth; at higher levels, produces audible distortion.

@subsubheading Features

@itemize @bullet
@item @strong{Multiple saturation curves}: Soft clip, hard clip, tape emulation, tube emulation
@item @strong{Anti-aliased processing}: ADAA (Anti-Derivative Anti-Aliasing) reduces digital artifacts
@item @strong{Drive control}: From subtle warmth to heavy distortion
@item @strong{Mix control}: Blend dry and saturated signal
@end itemize


